{"movie":"LOGIN","members":{"22":{"name":"psKeyboardControl","type":"text","text":"The key handling object    ","align":0,"rect":[0,0,324,16],"styles":[{"start":0,"height":16,"ascent":12,"style":1,"size":12,"color":"#000000","font":"Arial"}]},"23":{"name":"psEdunetics","type":"text","text":"2. Class: Edunetics\nThis is the root of the Edunetics class library. It is an abstract class that gives it\u2019s offspring the following capabilities: \n\u00b7 Self documentation (describe)\n\u00b7 Self destruction (dispose)\n\u00b7 Self name (getName)\n2.1. Cardinality: 0\n\n2.2.  Attributes:\n\n2.2.1.  Symbol psyName \nObject identity.\n2.3. Methods:\n\n2.3.1. birth\nLingo constructor\n2.3.1.1. Return Value: Object\nThe new object\n2.3.1.2. Parameters:\n2.3.1.2.1. me\nSelf pointer Lingo style\n2.3.1.2.2. Symbol syName\nThe identity of the new object\n2.3.2. vDescribe\nPrint the description text on the message window (Director)\n2.3.2.1. Return Value: Void\n<Description>\n2.3.2.2. Parameters:\n2.3.2.2.1. me\nLingo syntax.\n2.3.3. plObjectToList\nReturn the current state of the instance propeties as a property list where each property of the object is a property in the list and the same goes for values. If one of the values is an object by itself, it will be also replaced with such a property lis\n2.3.3.1. Return Value: PropertyList\nA property list with the current instance propeties' values.\n2.3.3.2. Parameters:\n2.3.3.2.1. LingoObject oMe\nLingo syntax.\n2.3.4. syListToProperties\nUpdate an instance properties value from a propety list.\n2.3.4.1. Return Value: Symbol\n#OK or #ERR_ListToProperties_PropertyNotExist:XX or #ERR_ListToProperties_WrongValue:XX\n2.3.4.2. Parameters:\n2.3.4.2.1. LingoObject oMe\nThe object to update.\n2.3.4.2.2. PropertyList plNewValues\nEach property must have a property in the object. The values will be stored in the matching property of the object.\n2.3.5. vDispose\nDo the clean-up of the object. User should assign it to the object for disposing.\n2.3.5.1. Return Value: Void\n<Description>\n2.3.5.2. Parameters:\n2.3.5.2.1. me\nLingo syntax.\nEnd of Class 'Edunetics'\n","align":0,"rect":[0,0,324,1008],"styles":[{"start":0,"height":16,"ascent":12,"style":0,"size":12,"color":"#000000","font":"Arial"}]},"41":{"name":"txtFontSample","type":"text","text":"This is the font to use.","align":0,"rect":[0,0,159,14],"styles":[{"start":0,"height":14,"ascent":11,"style":1,"size":12,"color":"#fffbf0","font":"MS Sans Serif"}]},"42":{"name":"txtUserID","type":"text","text":"defText","align":0,"rect":[0,0,214,14],"styles":[{"start":0,"height":14,"ascent":11,"style":1,"size":12,"color":"#fffbf0","font":"MS Sans Serif"}]},"43":{"name":"txtUserName","type":"text","text":"defText","align":1,"rect":[0,0,254,14],"styles":[{"start":0,"height":14,"ascent":11,"style":1,"size":12,"color":"#ffffff","font":"MS Sans Serif"}]},"44":{"name":"txtUserIDCopy","type":"text","text":"defText","align":1,"rect":[0,0,148,14],"styles":[{"start":0,"height":14,"ascent":11,"style":1,"size":12,"color":"#ffffff","font":"MS Sans Serif"}]},"45":{"name":"txtUserFirstName","type":"text","text":"defText","align":0,"rect":[0,0,159,14],"styles":[{"start":0,"height":14,"ascent":11,"style":1,"size":12,"color":"#fffbf0","font":"MS Sans Serif"}]},"46":{"name":"txtUserLastName","type":"text","text":"defText","align":0,"rect":[0,0,159,14],"styles":[{"start":0,"height":14,"ascent":11,"style":1,"size":12,"color":"#fffbf0","font":"MS Sans Serif"}]},"61":{"name":"cur fingerPoint,pic","type":"bitmap","w":15,"h":14,"regX":3,"regY":1,"depth":1,"rect":[57,54,72,68]},"62":{"name":"cur fingerPoint,msk","type":"bitmap","w":15,"h":14,"regX":3,"regY":1,"depth":1,"rect":[10,11,25,25]},"63":{"name":"cur openHand,pic","type":"bitmap","w":16,"h":15,"regX":8,"regY":7,"depth":1,"rect":[78,67,94,82]},"64":{"name":"cur openHand,msk","type":"bitmap","w":16,"h":15,"regX":8,"regY":7,"depth":1,"rect":[78,67,94,82]},"65":{"name":"cur closedHand,pic","type":"bitmap","w":15,"h":11,"regX":7,"re